# FCode design system (EASY-HOST)

Match FCode: dense native dev tool, monochrome canvas, hairline depth, ink CTAs.

## Surfaces
- Main columns: `bg-background` (never `bg-card`)
- Composer / grouped forms: `.composer` or `.surface-panel` + `--composer-surface`
- Dividers: `.chat-surface-divider` / `.chat-surface-divider-vertical` — not raw `border-border` splits

## Actions
- Primary run/send/stop: `Button variant="prominent"` (ink, rounded-full)
- Do not use `variant="default"` (blue) for full-width wizard/chat actions

## Agent UI
- Reuse `AgentFeed`, `chatTypography.ts`, ChatPanel header pattern (skill-chip + subtitle)

## Forms
- Labels: `text-[11px] text-muted-foreground`
- Controls: `w-full bg-secondary border-border` inside `surface-panel divide-y`

## Reference files
- `EASY-HOST/AGENTS.md` (full rules)
- `EASY-HOST/src/index.css`, `ChatPanel.tsx`, `WizardsView.tsx`
